We are urgently looking for a REMOTE Senior Machine Learning Engineer for an international organization in Geneva, Switzerland. Candidates need to be fluent in English. All positions are long-term. This position is open for freelancers and employees.

During the corona crisis, interviews will be done through WEBEX, and travel is not required for the interviews.

